    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Inbound message triage\nChained decisions on every incoming message:\n1. **Spam gate** (Noul) \n2. **Team routing** (Choice + Fallback)\n3. **Urgency** (Noul) for billing / technical, or **lead readiness** (Score) for sales\n\nAnything the model is unsure about (Fallback) or any failed call (error output) ends up in the human review queue. Destination nodes are NoOp placeholders: swap them for your real tools.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
